# verible.filelist -- the file list verible-verilog-ls reads to learn
# what this design consists of. Paths are relative to THIS directory
# (the one the language server is told is the project root).
#
# reticle reads the same file for its own local module lookup, so
# the editor and the language server agree on one list instead of each
# guessing (see PLAN.md, M56).

pkg/soc_pkg.sv
core/alu.sv
core/regfile.sv
core/clk_gate.sv
core/status_regs_stub.sv
mem/sram_wrapper.sv
mem/sram_bank.sv
mem/sram_dual_channel.sv
bus/axi4_lite_arbiter.sv
bus/axi4_lite_if.sv
top/soc_top.sv

# M133: NOT a source file -- an include search path. verible-verilog-ls
# ignores `+'-prefixed lines outright (measured: a references answer on
# `top/soc_top.sv' is byte-identical with and without this line), but
# reticle's own `lsp--filelist-incdirs' reads it to learn where this
# design's `` `include `` headers live, so it can tell slang-server
# (which never reads THIS file at all) via `slang.setBuildFile'.
+incdir+include
